   "evidence": "2026-10-14 18:54 UTC, throwaway customers (token ***), an empty cart from POST /carts for each request,\nbilling_street \"Stephansplatz 1\", billing_city \"Wien\", billing_country \"AT\":\nPOST /invoices { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: null, ... } -> 500 { message: \"Server Error\" } (API-0500)\nPOST /invoices { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: {}, ... } -> 500 { message: \"Something went wrong\" } (API-0501)\nPOST /invoices/guest { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: null, guest fields, ... }\n  -> 500 { message: \"Server Error\" } (API-0508)\n2026-10-15 17:38 UTC, API-0670 (tests/api/invoices/post-invoices-guest.spec.ts, repeated x3, same result), no token,\nAccept: application/json, an empty cart from POST /carts, the same billing fields, guest fields (email ***):\nPOST /invoices/guest { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: {}, ... } -> 500 { message: \"Something went wrong\" }\n2026-10-15 ~17:37 UTC, API-0668 (repeated x3): POST /invoices { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: null, ... }\n  -> 500 { message: \"Server Error\" }; the invoice row was left behind (BUG-040).\nSource (sprint5/API, c6032ad): StoreInvoice and InvoiceController::storeGuest (\"payment_details\" => ['present']);\nInvoiceController::store and storeGuest (Arr::except on payment_details); Handler.php (HY000 checked before 1364);\nmigration payment_bank_transfer_details (bank_name, account_name, account_number NOT NULL).",
