   "id": "BUG-040",
   "title": "A failed checkout leaves an orphan invoice without lines or payment",
   "status": "open",
   "severity": "minor",
   "layer": "api",
   "area": "invoices",
   "affects": [
    "POST /invoices",
    "POST /invoices/guest",
    "GET /invoices",
    "GET /invoices/search",
    "GET /invoices/{invoice_number}/download-pdf",
    "GET /invoices/{invoice_number}/download-pdf-status"
   ],
   "found": "2026-10-11",
   "ref": [
    "docs/api/contracts/Invoices_API.md#8-create-invoice",
    "docs/api/contracts/Invoices_API.md#notes"
   ],
   "description": "The invoice row is created before the cart is read and before the payment is saved, with no transaction (InvoiceService::createInvoice and createGuestInvoice, then InvoiceController::handlePayment). An unknown cart_id (404 \"Requested item not found\") leaves an invoice with subtotal and total null and no lines; a payment that fails (500, see BUG-041) leaves one with the cart's totals (0 for an empty cart) and no payment. A customer's orphan shows up in their GET /invoices; a guest's has user_id null, so only an admin sees it (GET /invoices/search). Orphans stay until the hourly re-seed (there is no DELETE /invoices). For a recheck, use the unknown-cart path (these steps, API-0499, API-0669). The failed-payment path (API-0668, API-0671) depends on BUG-041: if BUG-041 is fixed by validating payment_details before the invoice is created (422), API-0668 and API-0671 pass although this bug may still be open. API-0669 doesn't check its POST's status, so it also passes if that call fails for any other reason (a 422, a 5xx) before the invoice is created. Only a 404 from the POST followed by total 0 shows that this bug is fixed. An orphan without a payment also never gets a PDF: CreateInvoicePDF sets the download to IN_PROGRESS, then the invoice template fails on the missing payment ($invoice->payment->toArray(), invoice.blade.php), so the status stays IN_PROGRESS and the download answers 404; invoice:generate queues the job again every minute until the re-seed.",
   "steps": [
    "Register a customer and log in.",
    "Send POST /invoices with the customer's token and a well-formed ULID that no cart has as cart_id (the call answers 404).",
    "Send GET /invoices with the same token."
   ],
   "expected": "The list is empty: a failed checkout creates no invoice.",
   "actual": "GET /invoices (or, for a guest, an admin's GET /invoices/search) answers 200 with the orphan invoice: after an unknown cart_id with subtotal and total null, no lines and no payment (reproduced live on 2026-10-14, API-0499, and for POST /invoices/guest on 2026-10-15, API-0669); after a failed payment with subtotal and total 0 for an empty cart, no lines and no payment (reproduced live on 2026-10-15, API-0668, and for POST /invoices/guest on 2026-10-17, API-0671: user_id null). Such an orphan's GET /invoices/{invoice_number}/download-pdf-status stays 200 IN_PROGRESS and download-pdf answers 404 (2026-10-17).",
   "evidence": "2026-10-14 18:54 UTC, API-0499 (tests/api/invoices/post-invoices.spec.ts), a throwaway customer (token ***):\nPOST /invoices { payment_method: \"cash-on-delivery\", payment_details: {}, billing_street: \"Stephansplatz 1\",\n  billing_city: \"Wien\", billing_country: \"AT\", cart_id: \"01ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ\" }\n  -> 404 { message: \"Requested item not found\" }\nGET /invoices -> 200 { total: 1, data: [ { invoice_number: \"INV-2026000098\", status: \"AWAITING_FULFILLMENT\",\n  subtotal: null, total: null, lines: 0, payment_method: null } ] }\n2026-10-15 ~17:37 UTC, API-0668 (tests/api/invoices/post-invoices.spec.ts, repeated x3, same result), a throwaway\ncustomer (token ***), an empty cart from POST /carts:\nPOST /invoices { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: null, billing_street: \"Stephansplatz 1\",\n  billing_city: \"Wien\", billing_country: \"AT\", cart_id: <the cart's id> } -> 500 { message: \"Server Error\" } (BUG-041)\nGET /invoices -> 200 { total: 1, data: [ { invoice_number: \"INV-2026000025\", status: \"AWAITING_FULFILLMENT\",\n  subtotal: 0, total: 0, lines: 0, payment_method: null } ] }\n2026-10-15 17:38 UTC, API-0669 (tests/api/invoices/post-invoices-guest.spec.ts, repeated x3, same result), no token:\nPOST /invoices/guest { payment_method: \"cash-on-delivery\", payment_details: {}, billing_street: \"Street-20261015-0b8b14\",\n  billing_city: \"Wien\", billing_country: \"AT\", cart_id: \"01ZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ\", guest fields (email ***) }\n  -> 404 { message: \"Requested item not found\" }\nGET /invoices/search?q=Street-20261015-0b8b14 (admin token ***) -> 200 { total: 1, data: [ { invoice_number:\n  \"INV-2026000034\", user_id: null, status: \"AWAITING_FULFILLMENT\", subtotal: null, total: null, lines: 0,\n  payment_method: null } ] } (the repeats: INV-2026000036, INV-2026000037)\n2026-10-17 13:04 UTC, API-0671 (tests/api/invoices/post-invoices-guest.spec.ts, repeated x3, same result), no token,\nan empty cart from POST /carts:\nPOST /invoices/guest { payment_method: \"bank-transfer\", payment_details: {}, billing_street: \"Street-20261017-5dc392\",\n  billing_city: \"Wien\", billing_country: \"AT\", cart_id: <the cart's id>, guest fields (email ***) }\n  -> 500 { message: \"Something went wrong\" } (BUG-041; the same call in API-0670 of that run)\nGET /invoices/search?q=Street-20261017-5dc392 (admin token ***) -> 200 { total: 1, data: [ { invoice_number:\n  \"INV-2026000008\", user_id: null, status: \"AWAITING_FULFILLMENT\", subtotal: 0, total: 0, lines: 0,\n  payment_method: null } ] } (the repeats at 13:05: INV-2026000014, INV-2026000021, INV-2026000022)\nIn the 2026-10-14 run, the throwaway customers of API-0500 and API-0501 (payment failed with 500) could not be\ndeleted afterwards (409, still in use), which fits the orphan seen in API-0668.\nSource (sprint5/API, c6032ad): InvoiceService::createInvoice and createGuestInvoice call Invoice::create before\nCart::findOrFail; InvoiceController::store (lines 100-101) and storeGuest (lines 155-156) call handlePayment after it.\n2026-10-17 13:27 UTC, read-only GETs, admin token ***: INV-2026000016, 0017, 0019-0022, 0024-0029 (created\n13:05-13:09, payment null, 0 lines, user_id null; 0021 and 0022 are API-0671's) -> download-pdf-status 200\n{ \"status\": \"IN_PROGRESS\" }, download-pdf -> 404 { \"message\": \"Document not created. Try again later.\" };\ninvoices with a payment created at the same time (INV-2026000018, 0023) -> COMPLETED, download 200 PDF.\nSource (sprint5/API, c6032ad): app/Jobs/CreateInvoicePDF.php, resources/views/invoice.blade.php line 10251,\napp/Console/Commands/InvoiceGenerate.php.",
